# Vulnerabilities the docker-ci Trivy gate accepts. Read from the repo root, which
# is where the scan step runs. One CVE ID per line, each with a reason.
#
# --ignore-unfixed already drops CVEs with no fix available, so nothing belongs here
# solely because upstream has not patched it.
#
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN  # why accepted / when to revisit
